{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56183","headline":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 二十三 · 杜光庭","name":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 二十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丙戌年，秋来枯井泉。\n夏首虽然水，向後地焦然。\n此岁云龙起，稻出五湖边。\n中高徒种植，必定被灾缠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}